WEBVTT

00:10:59.379 --> 00:11:02.776
there are actually more translators
who are getting paid,

00:11:02.800 --> 00:11:05.316
because people are using
machine translation,

00:11:05.340 --> 00:11:09.164
it is not good enough,
and people pay humans to improve it.

00:11:09.188 --> 00:11:11.307
So they're actually making more money.

00:11:11.331 --> 00:11:13.402
But as technology improves,

00:11:13.426 --> 00:11:16.338
probably there will be
a lot fewer translators,

00:11:16.362 --> 00:11:18.783
especially casual ones.

00:11:18.807 --> 00:11:24.036
Translation will become something
that's only for novels and poetry

00:11:24.060 --> 00:11:29.078
and to represent the head of state,
so no mistake is tolerable.

00:11:29.428 --> 00:11:30.880
And as you said,